//- Email template adapted from https://github.com/leemunroe/responsive-html-email-template
//- Converted from HTML using https://html2pug.now.sh/

include baseEmail.pug

block content
  p Hi User,

  p Welcome to the Natours family! We're excited to have you on board.

  p To complete your registration, please verify your email address using the One-Time Password (OTP) below:

  table(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
    tbody
      tr
        td.btn.btn-primary
          table(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
            tbody
              tr
                td(style='font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;text-align:center;padding:12px 24px;')
                  | #{otp}

  p This OTP is valid for #{expiry} minutes. Please do not share it with anyone.

  p If you did not create a Natours account, you can safely ignore this email. No further action is required.

  p Happy Travels!
  p
    strong — Kavya Panchal
    br
    | Founder & CEO, Natours